{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My Banquet Planner\u00a0</strong>is the next-generation event planning simulator that empowers you to plan, visualize and experience event planning in a simulated environment. The engaging interface blends immersive 3D technology with practical event logistics, giving you a number of room layouts, personal styles, flow and more - all from your screen.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ceremony Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of <strong>layouts</strong> to create the perfect setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with <strong>lighting options</strong> to capture the right mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize the look with <strong>a variety of models\u00a0</strong>for a unique touch.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reception Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your reception with flexible <strong>layout selections</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust <strong>guest table arrangements</strong> to fit your vision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the <strong>head table</strong> to highlight the couple in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set the atmosphere with <strong>custom lighting</strong> that enhances every moment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863280?t=1770076666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863280/e35016c63c67f73226ac8f65827d293bd4b1c203/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770076666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863280/9f11a7b46fcc8333dab8f4025e283213ade261ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770076666","capsule_imagev5":"https